  "install_text": "**SM-3EA**\n\nThree-phase current meter for per-phase current monitoring.\n\n**Measured Parameters**\n- Current Phase A (mA)\n- Current Phase B (mA)\n- Current Phase C (mA)\n- Connection Type\n- Wi-Fi Signal Strength (dBm)\n\nThe device transmits a JSON object with 6 fields. Values are sent as numbers.",
